  "goodToKnow": "Die Thematik is the range of issues around a topic, and it sounds more formal and broader than das Thema: die Thematik des Klimawandels, mit der Thematik vertraut sein. It's used in academic writing, media and administration. The difference is subtle, and often Thematik is just a more impressive-sounding Thema. Das Thema is neuter and its plural is Themen, while die Thematik is feminine."
